{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/730579-blood-sorcery-themes","id":730579,"title":"Blood sorcery themes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-26T18:22:02-07:00","id":730579,"title":"Blood sorcery themes","content":"2, 3, or 4 experiences per dot?<br /> <br /> I'm leaning toward 3.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-26T22:37:26-07:00","id":731313,"title":"","content":"I did 3 xp myself, get a ritual with that as well as when you raise your Blood Sorcery.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Things need not have happened to be true. Tales and dreams are the shadow truths that will endure when mere facts are dust and ashes, and forgot.&quot; Sandman (Neil Gaiman)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/733-troller","name":"Troller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar733_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T02:00:13-07:00","id":731754,"title":"","content":"I totally didn't think of the free ritual. <br /> <br /> I agree with 3 xp.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T03:46:34-07:00","id":731849,"title":"","content":"In my games I used 4xp per dot of the Discipline (Cruac or Theban) and 2xp per Theme dot, but no free ritual.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T04:01:16-07:00","id":731867,"title":"","content":"That's fair. I'm trying to stay close to raw so I'm gonna keep the free rituals. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Oh, I did have another question: There's a table for taking extra time with rituals. 2 turns is +1 die, 5 turns is +2 dice, and one scene is +5 dice. Since the base time for a roll is <i>actually</i> 15 minutes, I assume that taking 30 minutes for a roll would be +1 die, but how long for +5 dice. A scene still? I am kind of going for an hour for +2 dice because I like nice even amounts.<br /> <br /> Or does the extended roll nature of things mean that the bonuses aren't really necessary?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2367,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","user":"Resplendent Fire","date":". 11-01-2015, 11:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-01T20:45:28-08:00","id":748310,"title":"","content":"2xp per theme dot, same as a ritual, only we don't bother with learned rituals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag","name":"Black Flag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar352_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-03T11:30:51-08:00","id":751851,"title":"","content":"I use 3 xp per Theme dot (keeping the free ritual). Rituals at level 3cost 1 XP, level 4+ cost 2 XP. The blood sorcery roll to learned rituals is Manipulation + Occult + Cr\u00faac or Intelligence + Academics + Theban Sorcery.<br /> Improvising rituals is possible, but have problems: roll by theme (using blood sorcery table), must define how many success want and suffers a cumulative -1 per roll. The time frame still the same.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/437-shadowninja","name":"shadowninja","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"62"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-03T16:55:26-08:00","id":752420,"title":"","content":"Thanks much. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath